    "enUS": {
      "description": "Rejold Barleybrew at Brewnall Village has been asking for you.\n\nHe wants to talk to you about a new drink he's been brewing...said something about you helping him with it.  You might want to head back to Brewnall Village and see what he has to say.\n\nThere could be some free booze in it for you...",
      "summary": "Speak with Rejold Barleybrew.",
      "title": "Rejold's New Brew",
